		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Purple figure garbed as a scholar or librarian, clothing patterned as a moth cocoon. Archivists of Purgatory.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 12, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 quill +0 (censor), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Censor</strong>. Erase or modify living target's last 24 hours of memories. If undead, CHA 15+ or stunned for 1 round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Magical Being</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Transform</strong>. When reduced to 0 HP, bursts open, releasing 1d4 spider swarms, viduus reforms in Purgatory.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
